    "body": "> Blink will also need this for `targetAddressSpace`. That means it is more likely to happen now.\n\nYes, we are now starting to look into this with a higher priority as one of the requirements for being able to be strict about requiring secure contexts for Local Network Access. Do let us know if we can help drive this forward.",
